Our workmanship warranty is 12 months on repairs and 24 months on installations. Parts carry the manufacturer warranty. Most tank water heaters have a 6-year manufacturer warranty on the tank, and we handle the claim paperwork. The warranty does not cover damage from freezing, misuse, or work done by anyone else after our visit.
